  "importedNotes": [
    {
      "text": "This was easy and very, very tasty. The best part was the top gets golden brown like cornbread, but the dish’s consistency is that of a thick pudding. I threw in a handful of grated cheddar cheese. Others have added a can of mild green chilies. The extra egg and cream gives this recipe more of a soufflé appearance. The Jiffy brand mix adds a little sweetness."
    },
    {
